  "notes": "{済|ず}み is a suffix meaning \"finished, already done,\" attached to many nouns and verb stems.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {支払|しはら}い{済|ず}みの{請求書|せいきゅうしょ}: paid invoice\n- {支払|しはら}い{済|ず}みマーク: \"paid\" stamp\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {未払|みばら}い: unpaid — the antonym\n- {入金済|にゅうきんず}み: payment received — the same state seen from the recipient's side",
